{
  "method": "recognizer_word_times",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "start": 0.68,
      "end": 3.34,
      "text": "In a Port Arthur refinery control room,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "start": 3.38,
      "end": 5.26,
      "text": "a screen is drawing a steam",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "start": 5.3,
      "end": 7.56,
      "text": "pressure dip that hasn't happened yet.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "start": 8.04,
      "end": 10.08,
      "text": "The refinery belongs to TotalEnergies,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "start": 10.18,
      "end": 11.58,
      "text": "in Jefferson County.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "start": 11.68,
      "end": 14.67,
      "text": "It runs about 238,000 barrels of",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "start": 14.71,
      "end": 17.02,
      "text": "crude a day through 47 units.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "start": 17.6,
      "end": 19.75,
      "text": "One of them is the delayed coker.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "start": 20.1,
      "end": 21.67,
      "text": "It uses high heat to",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10",
      "start": 21.71,
      "end": 24.14,
      "text": "crack heavy leftover oil into lighter,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c11",
      "start": 24.18,
      "end": 25.7,
      "text": "more valuable products.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c12",
      "start": 26.34,
      "end": 29.12,
      "text": "The coker's turbines need high pressure steam,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c13",
      "start": 29.16,
      "end": 30.84,
      "text": "and it has to keep coming.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c14",
      "start": 31.36,
      "end": 32.84,
      "text": "When a boiler falters,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c15",
      "start": 33.0,
      "end": 34.56,
      "text": "steam line pressure dips.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c16",
      "start": 34.9,
      "end": 36.68,
      "text": "A dip can trip a compressor,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c17",
      "start": 36.74,
      "end": 38.96,
      "text": "and the plant can shut down and flare.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c18",
      "start": 39.76,
      "end": 41.27,
      "text": "The console operator gets",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c19",
      "start": 41.31,
      "end": 42.55,
      "text": "little time to decide",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c20",
      "start": 42.59,
      "end": 44.34,
      "text": "which less critical equipment",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c21",
      "start": 44.38,
      "end": 45.68,
      "text": "gives up its steam.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c22",
      "start": 46.3,
      "end": 48.34,
      "text": "So in October 2024,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c23",
      "start": 48.65,
      "end": 50.69,
      "text": "TotalEnergies began testing a Honeywell",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c24",
      "start": 50.73,
      "end": 52.62,
      "text": "AI tool on the coker console.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c25",
      "start": 53.7,
      "end": 56.64,
      "text": "Honeywell's early count, in November 2025,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c26",
      "start": 56.94,
      "end": 58.92,
      "text": "was five potential events,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c27",
      "start": 59.02,
      "end": 60.1,
      "text": "flagged an average of",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c28",
      "start": 60.14,
      "end": 61.8,
      "text": "12 minutes before an alarm.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c29",
      "start": 62.34,
      "end": 63.89,
      "text": "A later account said",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c30",
      "start": 63.93,
      "end": 65.17,
      "text": "its models predicted pressure",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c31",
      "start": 65.21,
      "end": 68.08,
      "text": "dips 10 to 18 minutes earlier than before.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c32",
      "start": 68.28,
      "end": 70.54,
      "text": "That is a runway of time to act.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c33",
      "start": 71.46,
      "end": 73.1,
      "text": "Minutes change the job.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c34",
      "start": 73.67,
      "end": 76.04,
      "text": "Operators acted on at least two of its alerts.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c35",
      "start": 76.62,
      "end": 79.07,
      "text": "Thomas Klein, in process control there,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c36",
      "start": 79.11,
      "end": 80.99,
      "text": "said it was the first time AI at",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c37",
      "start": 81.03,
      "end": 83.46,
      "text": "the site caught a situation it had predicted.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c38",
      "start": 84.24,
      "end": 86.12,
      "text": "Not every model earned its place.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c39",
      "start": 86.46,
      "end": 87.64,
      "text": "One tried to predict the",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c40",
      "start": 87.68,
      "end": 88.84,
      "text": "level in the coke drums.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c41",
      "start": 89.08,
      "end": 90.91,
      "text": "It was right 75 percent of",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c42",
      "start": 90.95,
      "end": 92.9,
      "text": "the time and was still dropped,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c43",
      "start": 92.96,
      "end": 94.26,
      "text": "because drum switching depends",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c44",
      "start": 94.3,
      "end": 95.92,
      "text": "on things outside the model.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c45",
      "start": 96.84,
      "end": 100.06,
      "text": "Another tool turns past alarms on more than",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c46",
      "start": 100.1,
      "end": 101.57,
      "text": "300 coker tags into",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c47",
      "start": 101.61,
      "end": 103.22,
      "text": "examples of what worked before.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c48",
      "start": 103.64,
      "end": 106.26,
      "text": "Klein said it gave new operators high value.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c49",
      "start": 106.5,
      "end": 108.06,
      "text": "It is still in evaluation,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c50",
      "start": 108.1,
      "end": 109.1,
      "text": "and he presented it",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c51",
      "start": 109.14,
      "end": 110.8,
      "text": "at Honeywell's own user conference.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c52",
      "start": 111.66,
      "end": 113.36,
      "text": "Klein admits he was pessimistic.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c53",
      "start": 113.92,
      "end": 116.38,
      "text": "Now he says AI has room on the console,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c54",
      "start": 116.54,
      "end": 118.24,
      "text": "but it is not plug and play,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c55",
      "start": 118.28,
      "end": 119.64,
      "text": "and it needs support.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c56",
      "start": 120.22,
      "end": 121.57,
      "text": "His advice is to bring",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c57",
      "start": 121.61,
      "end": 122.94,
      "text": "operators in from the start.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c58",
      "start": 123.28,
      "end": 124.84,
      "text": "The gauge reads now.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c59",
      "start": 125.04,
      "end": 126.76,
      "text": "The screen reads next.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c60",
      "start": 127.02,
      "end": 128.92,
      "text": "The call is still the operator's.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    }
  ]
}
